      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Constant used to indicate that the input stream contains only Exif data. The format of the Exif-only data must follow the below structure: Exif Identifier Code ("Exif\0\0") + TIFF header + IFD data See JEITA CP-3451C Section 4.5.2 and 4.5.4 specifications for more details.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/ExifInterface#STREAM_TYPE_EXIF_DATA_ONLY" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.media.ExifInterface.STREAM_TYPE_EXIF_DATA_ONLY</code>.</a></format></para>
